<title>UK: HSBC Americas Q1 net income up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>HSBC Americas Q1 net income up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Loan loss provision    18.40		  vs 19.75</p>
<p> Pretax income	    163.8		  vs 135.3</p>
<p> Net income		 114.5		  vs 85.9</p>
<p> Assets		     32,200		 vs 21,600</p>
<p> Total liabilities	30,208		 vs 19,789</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the U.S. subsidiary of HSBC Holdings is HSBC Americas Inc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
